 ## Status
 
-- **Deploy 1 — prepared, not confirmed shipped.** This is a code-only release. No migrations, no changes to `db/schema.rb`, no database rows deleted, and no archives needed yet. Do not mark it shipped until the operator confirms the rollout is complete.
-- **Deploy 2 — not prepared.** Archive and remove the dedicated tables and unused columns after every Deploy 0 web and worker process has stopped.
