+- **Deploy 3 — not prepared.** Archive and clean up the remaining shared references and data, then retire the compatibility filters when safe. Wait for the operator to confirm Deploy 2 has shipped.
 
 ## Deploy 1 changes and rollout checks
 
@@ -20,14 +20,43 @@ Verification: the old and new code both read the same development database in re
 
 Before Deploy 2, a rollback of Deploy 1 is a code rollback; there is no database migration to reverse. Regenerate the sitemap after the rollout if the site serves a cached sitemap.
 
-## Deploy 2 handoff — schema and archives
+## Deploy 2 — schema and archives
 
